<title>UK: Banque Indosuez prices $75 mln two-year BOND. [CORRECTED 18:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Banque Indosuez prices $75 mln two-year BOND. [CORRECTED 18:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
